There are four '''Seasons''' in ''[[Stardew:Stardew Valley|Stardew Valley]]'': {{Icon|Spring}} Spring, {{Icon|Summer}} Summer, {{Icon|Fall}} Fall, and {{Icon|Winter}} Winter. Each Season lasts 28 days. 

'''Weather''' changes daily and with the seasons. Daily weather affects the types of [[Fish|fish]] that can be caught.

{{Info|For clarity, vanilla game mechanics can be reviewed at: [[Stardew:Seasons|Stardew Valley Wiki - Seasons]] or [[Stardew:Weather|Stardew Valley Wiki - Weather]].}}

